{"id": "c0b1d1f6-d4a4-471c-9cac-5a5a1d5984ee", "slug": "lumina-cognitive-engine", "title": "Lumina — Cognitive Engine", "description": "A cognitive engine landing page with animated signal visuals and masked reveal typography.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Lumina — Cognitive Engine\"\ndescription: \"A cognitive engine landing page with animated signal visuals and masked reveal typography.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#BAE6FD\"\n  secondary: \"#38BDF8\"\n  accent: \"#38BDF8\"\n  background: \"#4F46E5\"\n  surface: \"#BAE6FD\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#2A2C36\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Lumina — Cognitive Engine\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 118; favorites: 5; remixes: 0.\nTags: card, animated, webgl, bento, dither, action, effect.\n## Overview\nA cognitive engine landing page with animated signal visuals and masked reveal typography.\n\nInsights don't wait. lumina.io hello@lumina.io Lumina is a cognitive engine that transforms raw data streams into instant, actionable predictions for your enterprise. Now they guide.\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Insights don't wait.; Now they guide..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #BAE6FD, secondary #38BDF8, accent #38BDF8, background #4F46E5, surface #BAE6FD, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Lumina — Cognitive Engine</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"A cognitive engine landing page with animated signal visuals and masked reveal typography.\" />\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden bg-[#4f46e5] text-[#27262c] antialiased\" style=\"font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\">\n  <main class=\"min-h-screen w-full px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 sm:py-10 lg:px-10 lg:py-16\">\n    <section aria-label=\"Lumina cognitive engine landing hero\" class=\"mx-auto flex min-h-[calc(100vh-4rem)] w-full max-w-[1220px] items-center justify-center\">\n      <div class=\"relative grid w-full overflow-hidden shadow-[0_24px_90px_rgba(8,20,92,0.16)] md:grid-cols-2\" style=\"min-height: min(78vh, 33rem);\">\n        <div class=\"relative min-h-[23rem] overflow-hidden bg-[#1a1c29] md:min-h-[33rem]\">\n          <canvas id=\"signalCanvas\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full\"></canvas>\n\n          <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 33% 42%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.16), transparent 24%), radial-gradient(circle at 58% 60%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12), transparent 22%), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(20,19,23,0.18), transparent 34%, rgba(20,19,23,0.14));\"></div>\n\n          <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\">\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[7%] top-[18%] h-[4.6rem] w-[18%] rounded-t-xl bg-[#2a2c36]/80\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[24%] top-[18%] h-[5.8rem] w-[18%] rounded-t-xl bg-[#2a2c36]/80\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[40%] top-[40%] h-[4.6rem] w-[18%] rounded-b-xl bg-[#2a2c36]/90\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[55%] top-[18%] h-[5.8rem] w-[18%] rounded-t-xl bg-[#2a2c36]/85\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[58%] top-[40%] h-[4.6rem] w-[18%] rounded-b-xl bg-[#2a2c36]/90\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[24%] top-[63%] h-[5.8rem] w-[18%] rounded-b-xl bg-[#2a2c36]/70\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[58%] top-[63%] h-[5.8rem] w-[18%] rounded-b-xl bg-[#2a2c36]/70\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[76%] top-[63%] h-[4.6rem] w-[22%] rounded-t-xl bg-[#2a2c36]/70\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-95\">\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-0 top-[6%] h-4 w-[43%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(99,102,241,0.14), #6366f1 70%, #0ea5e9);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-[48%] top-[11.5%] h-4 w-[52%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb 40%, #8b5cf6 100%);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-0 top-[14.5%] h-4 w-[28%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #06b6d4, #a5f3fc);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-0 top-[21%] h-4 w-[10.5%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #60a5fa);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-[10.2%] top-[24%] h-4 w-[90%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #bfdbfe, #6366f1 48%, #0284c7);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-0 top-[31%] h-4 w-[76%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #bae6fd, #8b5cf6 48%, #0284c7);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-0 top-[37.5%] h-4 w-[30%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6366f1, #4338ca);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-[53.5%] top-[41%] h-4 w-[40%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e0f2fe, #8b5cf6 45%, #3b82f6);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-0 top-[47%] h-4 w-[100%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(59,130,246,0.35), #6366f1 46%, #0ea5e9);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-[7%] top-[53.5%] h-4 w-[83%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f0f9ff, #3b82f6 37%, #a5b4fc 100%);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-0 top-[59.5%] h-4 w-[37%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(139,92,246,0.12), #6366f1 62%, #2563eb);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-[56%] top-[60%] h-4 w-[44%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(139,92,246,0.2), #6366f1 40%, rgba(14,165,233,0.42));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-[24.5%] top-[64.8%] h-4 w-[13%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2563eb, #8b5cf6);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-0 top-[69.5%] h-4 w-[49.5%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6366f1, #38bdf8 100%);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-[50.5%] top-[69.5%] h-4 w-[49.5%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #6366f1 70%, rgba(59,130,246,0.28));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-0 top-[76.2%] h-4 w-[100%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6366f1, #2563eb 55%, rgba(14,165,233,0.18));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-[81%] top-[82%] h-4 w-[19%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #bae6fd, #7dd3fc);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-0 top-[91.5%] h-4 w-[46%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(139,92,246,0.38), #8b5cf6 45%, rgba(59,130,246,0.38));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"signal-bar absolute left-[50%] top-[88.5%] h-4 w-[50%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #38bdf8, #6366f1 62%, rgba(14,165,233,0.34));\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"relative min-h-[31rem] overflow-hidden bg-[#e0f8ff] md:min-h-[33rem]\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(88,200,255,0.18) 0 4%, transparent 4% 10%), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(229,245,255,0.94), rgba(213,240,255,0.94)); background-size: 100% 3.4rem, 100% 100%;\">\n          <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-75\">\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[2%] top-[3%] h-4 w-[42%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(186,230,253,0), rgba(56,189,248,0.52), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[49%] top-[5%] h-4 w-[28%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(186,230,253,0), rgba(56,189,248,0.5), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[86%] top-[5%] h-4 w-[12%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(186,230,253,0), rgba(56,189,248,0.55));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[0%] top-[12%] h-4 w-[78%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(125,211,252,0.22), rgba(56,189,248,0.35), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[16%] top-[17%] h-4 w-[28%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(125,211,252,0), rgba(56,189,248,0.46), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[50%] top-[16.5%] h-4 w-[50%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(125,211,252,0), rgba(56,189,248,0.32), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[3%] top-[25%] h-4 w-[68%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(186,230,253,0), rgba(56,189,248,0.48), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[0%] top-[30%] h-4 w-[36%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(56,189,248,0.32), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[46%] top-[34%] h-4 w-[53%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(186,230,253,0), rgba(56,189,248,0.42), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[3%] top-[55%] h-4 w-[44%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(186,230,253,0), rgba(56,189,248,0.44), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[55%] top-[60%] h-4 w-[44%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(186,230,253,0), rgba(56,189,248,0.5), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[0%] top-[66%] h-4 w-[65%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(125,211,252,0.4), rgba(56,189,248,0.42), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[68%] top-[70%] h-4 w-[28%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(186,230,253,0), rgba(56,189,248,0.48), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n            <div class=\"data-line absolute left-[8%] top-[78%] h-4 w-[51%]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(186,230,253,0), rgba(56,189,248,0.5), rgba(186,230,253,0));\"></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"relative z-10 grid h-full min-h-[31rem] grid-rows-[1fr_auto_1fr] px-8 py-10 sm:px-12 md:min-h-[33rem] md:px-14 lg:px-16\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-end\">\n              <h1 class=\"reveal max-w-[17rem] text-left text-5xl font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-tight text-[#29282f] sm:text-6xl\">\n                Insights don't wait.\n              </h1>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid items-start gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr]\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-10 pt-1 text-sm font-medium text-[#2b2a31]\">\n                <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Lumina homepage\" class=\"transition hover:opacity-70\">lumina.io</a>\n                <a href=\"mailto:hello@lumina.io\" class=\"transition hover:opacity-70\">hello@lumina.io</a>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"reveal max-w-[19rem] text-sm font-medium leading-tight text-[#2b2a31] sm:justify-self-end\">\n                Lumina is a cognitive engine that transforms raw data streams into instant, actionable predictions for your enterprise.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid items-end gap-8 sm:grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.65fr]\">\n              <h2 class=\"reveal max-w-[22rem] text-5xl font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-tight text-[#29282f] sm:text-6xl\">\n                Now they guide.\n              </h2>\n\n              <div class=\"justify-self-start sm:justify-self-center\">\n                <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid grid-cols-5 gap-2\">\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-[#4f46e5]\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-[#4f46e5]\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-[#4f46e5]\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-[#4f46e5]\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-[#4f46e5]\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-[#4f46e5]\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-transparent\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-[#4f46e5]\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-transparent\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-[#4f46e5]\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-transparent\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-[#4f46e5]\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-[#4f46e5]\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-[#4f46e5]\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mark-tile h-4 w-4 rounded-[0.18rem] bg-transparent\"></span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-black/5\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function () {\n      gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n      document.querySelectorAll(\".reveal\").forEach(function (el) {\n        const words = el.textContent.trim().split(/\\s+/);\n        el.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", el.textContent.trim());\n        el.innerHTML = words.map(function (word) {\n          return '<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-inner inline-block translate-y-full\">' + word + '</span></span>';\n        }).join(\" \");\n      });\n\n      gsap.set(\".reveal-inner\", { yPercent: 112, rotate: 2, transformOrigin: \"left bottom\" });\n      gsap.utils.toArray(\".reveal\").forEach(function (el) {\n        gsap.to(el.querySelectorAll(\".reveal-inner\"), {\n          yPercent: 0,\n          rotate: 0,\n          duration: 0.95,\n          ease: \"power4.out\",\n          stagger: 0.065,\n          scrollTrigger: {\n            trigger: el,\n            start: \"top 88%\",\n            once: true\n          }\n        });\n      });\n\n      gsap.fromTo(\".signal-bar\", \n        { scaleX: 0.72, x: -24, opacity: 0.58, transformOrigin: \"left center\" },\n        { scaleX: 1, x: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1.45, ease: \"expo.out\", stagger: 0.035, delay: 0.12 }\n      );\n\n      gsap.to(\".signal-bar\", {\n        x: function (i) { return i % 2 ? 18 : -14; },\n        opacity: function (i) { return i % 3 ? 0.86 : 0.62; },\n        duration: function (i) { return 2.4 + (i % 5) * 0.28; },\n        repeat: -1,\n        yoyo: true,\n        ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n        stagger: 0.04\n      });\n\n      gsap.fromTo(\".data-line\",\n        { scaleX: 0.65, opacity: 0.2, transformOrigin: \"left center\" },\n        { scaleX: 1, opacity: 0.78, duration: 1.8, ease: \"power3.out\", stagger: 0.06, delay: 0.28 }\n      );\n\n      gsap.to(\".data-line\", {\n        x: function (i) { return i % 2 ? -12 : 14; },\n        opacity: function (i) { return i % 3 ? 0.32 : 0.58; },\n        duration: function (i) { return 3.4 + (i % 4) * 0.35; },\n        repeat: -1,\n        yoyo: true,\n        ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n        stagger: 0.08\n      });\n\n      gsap.fromTo(\".mark-tile\",\n        { scale: 0, opacity: 0, rotate: -8 },\n        { scale: 1, opacity: 1, rotate: 0, duration: 0.55, ease: \"back.out(1.8)\", stagger: { each: 0.035, from: \"center\" }, delay: 0.9 }\n      );\n\n      const canvas = document.getElementById(\"signalCanvas\");\n      const gl = canvas.getContext(\"webgl\", { alpha: true, antialias: false, premultipliedAlpha: true });\n\n      if (gl) {\n        const vertexSource = `\n          attribute vec2 a_position;\n          varying vec2 v_uv;\n          void main() {\n            v_uv = a_position * 0.5 + 0.5;\n            gl_Position = vec4(a_position, 0.0, 1.0);\n          }\n        `;\n\n        const fragmentSource = `\n          precision mediump float;\n          varying vec2 v_uv;\n          uniform float u_time;\n          uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n\n          float hash(vec2 p) {\n            return fract(sin(dot(p, vec2(127.1, 311.7))) * 43758.5453123);\n          }\n\n          float noise(vec2 p) {\n            vec2 i = floor(p);\n            vec2 f = fract(p);\n            vec2 u = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n            return mix(\n              mix(hash(i + vec2(0.0, 0.0)), hash(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0)), u.x),\n              mix(hash(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0)), hash(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0)), u.x),\n              u.y\n            );\n          }\n\n          void main() {\n            vec2 uv = v_uv;\n            vec2 p = uv;\n            p.x *= u_resolution.x / max(u_resolution.y, 1.0);\n\n            float scan = sin((uv.y * 42.0) + u_time * 1.25) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n            float bands = smoothstep(0.72, 1.0, scan);\n            float grain = noise(vec2(uv.x * 18.0 + u_time * 0.18, uv.y * 34.0 - u_time * 0.1));\n\n            float glowA = exp(-distance(p, vec2(0.42, 0.42)) * 5.2);\n            float glowB = exp(-distance(p, vec2(0.93, 0.36)) * 4.4);\n            float glowC = exp(-distance(p, vec2(0.62, 0.74)) * 5.8);\n\n            vec3 cyan = vec3(0.18, 0.8, 1.0);\n            vec3 blue = vec3(0.16, 0.4, 1.0);\n            vec3 purple = vec3(0.6, 0.3, 1.0);\n\n            vec3 color = cyan * glowA * 0.15 + blue * glowB * 0.12 + purple * glowC * 0.09;\n            color += mix(cyan, blue, uv.x) * bands * grain * 0.035;\n\n            float alpha = clamp((glowA + glowB + glowC) * 0.18 + bands * grain * 0.055, 0.0, 0.28);\n            gl_FragColor = vec4(color, alpha);\n          }\n        `;\n\n        function shader(type, source) {\n          const s = gl.createShader(type);\n          gl.shaderSource(s, source);\n          gl.compileShader(s);\n          return s;\n        }\n\n        const program = gl.createProgram();\n        gl.attachShader(program, shader(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, vertexSource));\n        gl.attachShader(program, shader(gl.FRAG